## What This Is

This repository ships an AI automation package for GitHub Copilot: an automated **ticket-to-PR
workflow** (`fix ticket`) and an **accessibility (ADA/WCAG) fix workflow** (`/fixada-*`). Both are
domain-aware — they load `.ai/knowledge-base.md` (the project's domain, rules, and architecture
reference) before making any change.

